===Man-made disasters===
*2144 - The [[Loss of Spirit]] - On August 29, the ISV-17 Spirit experiences a catastrophic failure of its White-Alcubierre drive, causing an infinite mass expansion and killing all 753 crew members on board.
*2159 - The [[Lugh Disaster]] - Research teams at the gas giant 2M1207b in the Centaurus constellation deploy Gravitational Field Generators deep into the atmosphere of the planet, the hope being to initiate fusion and create a brown dwarf star. A software glitch causes the gravity well to grow beyond the parameters of the mission and the premature fusion ignition causes the destruction of entire research outpost.

